@startuml On the Road Process

title Process: leading the convoy on the road
caption Target design. Decisions X2, O20, O27, O18, X10, P14, O2, O28, O5, O1. Plans 14 and 18.

|Convoy Leader|
start
:Brief the other drivers by radio;
note right: other drivers get no route or destination details (O1)

repeat
  :Reach the next route point or accommodation;
  if (Signal and the checklist page available?) then (yes)
    :Mark it reached on the page;
  else (no)
    :Call or radio HQ, use printed documents;
    |Dispatcher|
    :Record the mark on the leader's behalf;
    |Convoy Leader|
  endif

  if (Border point?) then (yes)
    :Mark the border crossed;
    |Freedom|
    :Close that authority's declarations;
    |Convoy Leader|
  else (no)
  endif

  if (Customs refuse a box?) then (yes)
    if (Kept by customs?) then (yes)
      :Record the box as seized;
    else (sent back)
      :Choose a registered hub;
      :Record the box as returned to that hub;
    endif
    |Freedom|
    :Remove the box from the vehicle's load;
    :Open declarations go stale; re-declare task raised;
    |Convoy Leader|
  else (no)
  endif

  if (Box damaged or stolen?) then (yes)
    :Record the box as undeliverable, with reason;
  else (no)
  endif

  if (Refuelled?) then (yes)
    :Enter the fuel cost;
  else (no)
  endif
repeat while (Destination reached?) is (no)
->yes;
stop

@enduml
